# Everything in this repository is consumed by Linux: the build runs in WSL
# reading straight from this Windows checkout, and the TWRP installer runs
# under /sbin/sh, where a CRLF shebang fails to execute at all.
#
# Forcing eol=lf repository-wide removes that whole class of bug, including for
# the extensionless scripts under packaging/ that a per-extension rule misses.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.img binary
*.xz binary
*.gz binary
*.zst binary
*.zip binary
*.deb binary
*.dtb binary
*.dtbo binary
*.bin binary

# Unified diffs legitimately prefix blank context lines with one space and
# preserve context indentation after their marker. Validate the carried code
# with checkpatch instead of treating those markers as defects in the patch
# container itself.
*.patch whitespace=-blank-at-eol,-space-before-tab
